  "actualReview": {
    "saveAndReturn": "All48 unique settled runs and192 saved states are exact. Every adjacent trip continues its actual preceding prepared state, including both deaths. Four starting branches retain the same earned cycle30/reserve20/modules/growth/inventory; they are not48 independent novice samples.",
    "searchAndRisk": "42 trips completed non-entry pickup and extraction; all100 actual pickups were beyond320px from entry and99 belonged to extracted trips. Four genuine empty extractions and two deaths remain failures to bring back searched remains. Some severe trips were short and retained full health, while severe1 ended at10HP/chaos150; no claim that every severe trip enforced the same pressure.",
    "failureContinuations": "medium9 empty→medium10 death leaves prepared reserve1; medium11 then extracts3 non-entry remains and18kindling from that actual save. severe3 death→severe4 empty leaves reserve9; severe5 then extracts3 non-entry remains. No three-trip failed-search streak, whole-branch no-search, repeated preparation refusal or technical interruption was flagged. This is bounded evidence of continuation under the tested controller, not a prediction of player survival.",
    "emptyOutcomes": "low7 laminate-shell has no completed pickup despite6 uncollected nodes; its route stop does not prove missing or unreachable loot. medium9 buried-lamellae shows a real E prompt but no completed pickup. severe4 bleached-court and severe7 draped-bay refuse a nearby-opponent search and extract empty with25/55HP. Root viewed all four empty outcomes and both death sequences; one still cannot isolate their cause.",
    "toolsAndCost": "The exact original input review reconciles Q79attempts/76uses,F52/47,G80/63,including zero-consumption presses,slot identity and passive exclusion. Four still-charged active tools lost on settled death are not counted as uses. Root also reconciled all reserve movements:550kindling returned,267repair and314growth,net−31 across four branches,final reserves11/9/5/24.47 newly returned items and58 destroyed IDs remain distinct from death losses. Higher160maxHP in alternating12 agrees with the actual growth_vitality4 save.",
    "recurrence": "Across44 within-branch transitions there were0 immediate repeats,1 near-neighbor transition and1 within-eight revisit. low4→12 gel-rafts retains the recognizable authored bank; medium1→12 red-vault-fragments repeats outside the eight-visit window. alternating4 spliced-reaches→5 split-tows shares fibre-knot/fallen-bundle families but actual local frames have different spacing/orientation. These soft-weight outcomes remain; no reroll or forced uniqueness was used.",
    "materialSequence": "medium3 cleft-tableland,4 ash-strata,5 split-fall share folded-slab material while their descriptor shape strings differ. Root viewed all three local frames; split-fall is mostly quiet lit floor and cannot establish strong whole-map shape contrast. The original full-library art review and gallery remain separate.48 trips do not establish all108-world visual fatigue or distribution significance.",
    "decision": "The actual finite histories, paid continuation, pressure/empty/death evidence and sampled recurrence do not expose an unresolved mandatory blocker for this internal expansion gate. Bounded pass is issued after reading actual receipts and images; the original automatic reviewer remains pending-experience by design and is not edited."
  },
